{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04982","headline":"仪坤庙乐章 · 刘知几","name":"仪坤庙乐章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妙算申帷幄，神谋出庙廷。\n两阶文物备，七德武功成。\n校猎长杨苑，屯军细柳营。\n将军献凯入，歌舞溢重城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘知几","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}